OL,3,GNEWSATeacher banned over teen YouTube
OL,4,Asearches
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teacher has been banned after pupils
OL,7,Fat a Shropshire girls' school reported
OL,8,Fteenage YouTube searches shown in a
OL,9,Fgeography lesson, the Teaching
OL,10,FRegulation Agency [TRA] said.
OL,12,FIn May 2025, pupils raised concerns
OL,13,Fabout James Hindson, who worked at
OL,14,FMoreton Hall, after previous searches
OL,15,Fwere displayed on a large screen,
OL,16,Frevealing one or more of "teen bikini
OL,17,Fhaul", "teens in thongs" and "girls in
OL,18,Fthongs".
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
