OL,3,GNEWSATeacher banned over teen YouTube
OL,4,Asearches
OL,5,
OL,6,FHindson, now 69, who was dismissed from
OL,7,Fthe Oswestry school, said he was
OL,8,Fsearching for a clip to illustrate
OL,9,Faspects of global trade and
OL,10,Faccidentally showed searches.
OL,12,FA panel found "proven facts amount to
OL,13,Funacceptable professional conduct
OL,14,Fand/or conduct that may bring the
OL,15,Fprofession into disrepute".
